{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《衛蘭OUT OF FRAME世界巡迴演唱會》香港站今晚於紅館舉行首場，不少圈中人捧場，除好姊妹鍾舒漫與王君馨，還有泳兒、蔡思貝、洪嘉豪、雲浩影等，當中朱芸編與女友COLLAR成員陳泳伽（Winka）、黃淑蔓與男友林子峰拍拖到場。衛蘭以暗黑女王造型登場，一口氣獻唱《Break-a-way》、《My Cookie Can》及《一格格》為個唱揭開序幕。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T13:45:55.919932+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T13:00:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T13:39:21.890795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T13:39:21.890795+00:00","content_hash":"86531324e9af09786b0eb02ad6ba04eab103dee869101b5743ea4be2afe97a7b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}